Cons: enemies are pretty much the same, except for bosses;
- difficulty is very different on bosses and during all other time;
- game sometimes crashes, and continuing works... pretty strange, e. g. I was unable to finish prologue, since I started it, then left, and when I continued game, I was already past that part;
- controls are a bit clumsy (or is it a feature, don't know), playing with keyboard is pretty hard;
- and the game is pretty demanding on your hardware, it's slow, although not that beautiful to justify that kind of slowness.
A game for very limited time to enjoy, I would say.

